{"3176770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eclipse of The Shadow", "steam_appid": 3176770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate through the depths of the underground base, advancing floor by floor to reach the surface and survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/18eee3c713799bb2fd7202736d87671f.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/18eee3c713799bb2fd7202736d87671f.webm?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/18eee3c713799bb2fd7202736d87671f.mp4?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the unique characteristics of the various AI monsters residing on each floor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Follow the guidance of the AI robot <strong>Lumi</strong> to collect essential survival items and find your way out of the underground facility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a388d9cf8ff565bd30e892a3e226745b.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a388d9cf8ff565bd30e892a3e226745b.webm?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a388d9cf8ff565bd30e892a3e226745b.mp4?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last survivor trapped deep within the underground base. Follow the instructions of the AI <strong>Lumi</strong> to evade the creatures lurking in the darkness and make your escape to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/8dd5d62f5a8d15791b086ebff03e2ab0.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/8dd5d62f5a8d15791b086ebff03e2ab0.webm?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/8dd5d62f5a8d15791b086ebff03e2ab0.mp4?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Systems</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters on each floor enforce different survival methods: beings sensitive to ambient sounds, entities that freeze when observed, and those that are unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/9ef1a8588163ec7edf42e2d7f96482d0.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/9ef1a8588163ec7edf42e2d7f96482d0.webm?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/9ef1a8588163ec7edf42e2d7f96482d0.mp4?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right before your final escape, an intense chase sequence begins, where the entire base appears to collapse. Experience the ultimate thrill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a631c7c98ef86b01695e27d70c27dbaf.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a631c7c98ef86b01695e27d70c27dbaf.webm?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a631c7c98ef86b01695e27d70c27dbaf.mp4?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: This game contains the following elements:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense and persistent horror elements, as well as sudden startling moments (<strong>Jumpscares</strong>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer TMI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was planned, developed, and produced entirely by a single 19-year-old student.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate through the depths of the underground base, advancing floor by floor to reach the surface and survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/18eee3c713799bb2fd7202736d87671f.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\