791b086ebff03e2ab0.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/8dd5d62f5a8d15791b086ebff03e2ab0.webm?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/8dd5d62f5a8d15791b086ebff03e2ab0.mp4?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Systems</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters on each floor enforce different survival methods: beings sensitive to ambient sounds, entities that freeze when observed, and those that are unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/9ef1a8588163ec7edf42e2d7f96482d0.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/9ef1a8588163ec7edf42e2d7f96482d0.webm?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/9ef1a8588163ec7edf42e2d7f96482d0.mp4?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right before your final escape, an intense chase sequence begins, where the entire base appears to collapse. Experience the ultimate thrill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a631c7c98ef86b01695e27d70c27dbaf.poster.avif?t=1767691402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a631c7c98ef86b01695e27d70c27dbaf.webm?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/extras/a631c7c98ef86b01695e27d70c27dbaf.mp4?t=1767691402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: This game contains the following elements:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense and persistent horror elements, as well as sudden startling moments (<strong>Jumpscares</strong>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer TMI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was planned, developed, and produced entirely by a single 19-year-old student.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In &quot;Eclipse of the Shadow&quot;, you’re the last survivor in a monster-infested space station. With limited resources and an AI guide, you must solve puzzles, send a distress signal, and escape. Can you survive in this station?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/359b6242747ba9583a6130888c7f00fde689b6a7/header.jpg?t=1767691402", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/4390d233fbd572aae9ba4d04b8a9f6bac150f866/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767691402", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176770/4390d233fbd572aae9ba4d04b8a9f6bac150f866/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767691402", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor: